#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:51
#: 5ee1046150684fd5b95ca19c9b01feec
msgid ""
"The IR-LOCK sensor can be connected directly to the autopilot via an `I2C"
" cable <https://irlock.com/collections/shop/products/pixhawk-cable>`__. "
"If you are using multiple I2C sensors, then you will need an \\ `I2C "
"splitter <https://store.mrobotics.io/mRo-DF13-I2C-Bus-Splitter-for-"
"Pixhawk-p/mro-df13-i2c-split-5-mr.htm>`__. More detailed instructions are"
" included in the `IR-LOCK documentation "
"<https://irlock.readme.io/docs>`__."
msgstr ""

